IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PEN0048.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    COPY PEN0048C REPLACING ==:PFX:== BY ==TX==.
01 OUT-RECORD.
    05 ACCOUNT-STAT       PIC X VALUE 'A'.
    05 LATE-FEE           PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
A000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM 4000-REPEAT-LATE
    PERFORM COLLECTIONS-CHECK
    DISPLAY "ACCOUNT-STAT=" ACCOUNT-STAT
    DISPLAY "LATE-FEE=" LATE-FEE
    STOP RUN.
4000-REPEAT-LATE.
    IF TX-LATE-CNT-12M >= 4 AND TX-DAYS-LATE > 45
        MOVE 'S' TO ACCOUNT-STAT
        ADD 50 TO LATE-FEE
    END-IF.
COLLECTIONS-CHECK.
    IF TX-DAYS-LATE > 60
        MOVE 'C' TO ACCOUNT-STAT
    END-IF.
